@page "/getting-started"
<PageHeading Title="Setup" />
<section class="panel">
    <h2>Run</h2>
    <pre><code>pnpm --dir src/BQuery/wwwroot install --frozen-lockfile
pnpm --dir src/BQuery/wwwroot run build
dotnet run --project Sample/BQuery.Sample.Server # localhost:5301
dotnet run --project Sample/BQuery.Sample.Wasm   # localhost:5302
dotnet run --project Sample/BQuery.Sample.Auto   # localhost:5303</code></pre>
    <p>Wasm and Auto share Client. All hosts use Common components.</p>
</section>
<section class="panel">
    <h2>Registration</h2>
    <pre><code>builder.Services.AddBQuery();
&lt;script src="_content/BQuery/dist/bQuery.min.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;script src="_framework/blazor.web.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre>
    <p>Register services in each host and Client. Run DOM interop after interactive rendering. Unsubscribe delegates and remove drag bindings on disposal.</p>
</section>
<details class="panel">
    <summary>Constants and source generation</summary>
    <code class="call">@constantExample</code>
    <p>JsModuleConstants.GetMethod joins module and method names. ElePosition contains X, Y, Width and Height; ResizeEventArgs contains Width and Height; DragOptions selects the trigger and viewport constraint.</p>
    <p>GenerateJsInteropMethods generates method paths. GenerateWindowEvents reads WindowEventHandler metadata to generate events and JS callbacks. Consumers need no generator configuration.</p>
    <p>Auto may use WebAssembly on a subsequent visit after runtime resources download. An active page does not switch runtimes.</p>
</details>
<details class="panel">
    <summary>API coverage</summary>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>API</th><th>Demo</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    @foreach(var row in coverage){<tr><td>@row.Api</td><td><a href="@row.Route">@row.Label</a></td></tr>}
    </tbody></table></div>
</details>
<SourcePanel File="Pages/GettingStarted.razor" /><SourcePanel File="Components/LabComponent.cs" />
